<title>SAUDI ARABIA: SOCCER-MALAYSIA BEAT BANGLADESH 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MALAYSIA BEAT BANGLADESH 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>JEDDAH, Saudi Arabia 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia beat Bangladesh 1-0 in a World Cup Asian Zone group one qualifying match on Monday (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Zain al-Abedine pen. 32</p>
</text>
